5020 XR=XR-1:IF XR<1 THEN XR=1
5030 GOSUB 4000
5040 RETURN
5050 REM CURSOR DOWN
5055 GOSUB 8000
5060 GOSUB 4100
5070 XR=XR+1:IF XR>9 THEN XR=9
